<h1>ModigPrepareTrial_TWOAFC_TOUCH
</h1>

<h2><a name="_name"></a>PURPOSE <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>Prepares trial parameters in project 'TWOAFC_TOUCH'</strong></div>

<h2><a name="_synopsis"></a>SYNOPSIS <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="box"><strong>function runned = ModigPrepareTrial_TWOAFC_TOUCH </strong></div>

<h2><a name="_description"></a>DESCRIPTION <a href="#_top"><img alt="^" border="0" src="../../../../up.png"></a></h2>
<div class="fragment"><pre class="comment"> Prepares trial parameters in project 'TWOAFC_TOUCH'
 
 Epochs:
 1. pre-trial
 2. choiceApp
 3. targetOn
 4. choiceApp
 5. us
 6. post_trial
 7. iti
 8. error

 RBM 3.08
     4.08  
     6.08 giving option</pre></div>

